title1", "maxW": 2120, "page": "alerts"}, "s_motion_brand": {"x": 1600, "y": 2380, "w": 360, "text": "Every Neelu you see is a poster frame. In the app each one is an animation slot (see the motion library board) filled by a Gemini-generated, transparent-background clip. The static pose is the fallback while it loads.", "fill": "orange", "page": "brand"}, "s_motion_onb": {"x": -460, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Neelu here = animation slot. Splash: fan_reveal · Welcome/Meet: wave_hello · Questions: idle_bob · Building: think_scan · Plan: dance_celebrate · Reminders: ring_bell", "fill": "orange", "page": "onboarding"}, "s_motion_home": {"x": -460, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Home stage swaps clips by state: idle_breathe (default), wave_hello (first day), hungry_tummy (missed), dance_celebrate (goal), shrug_okay (over), sleep_zzz (night). Streak card sits right under the stage.", "fill": "orange", "page": "home"}, "s_motion_log": {"x": -460, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Animation slots: peek_sheet (log sheet), think_scan (analysing), happy_hop (logged), sad_droop (failed / camera denied), listen_ear (voice).", "fill": "orange", "page": "logging"}, "s_motion_prog": {"x": -460, "y": 0, "w": 360, "text": "Animation slots: shades_flip (streak), dance_celebrate (badge), think_scan (empty insights), idle_bob (weight).", "fill": "orange", "page": "progress"}}, "designSystems": []}